{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46の井上梨名です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は卒業を実感することが多く、楽しいことも、寂しくなることも、いろいろです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業発表後のミーグリでは、皆さんからたくさん温かい言葉を頂けて、この7年間素敵なことだらけだったなと改めて思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後までたくさん思い出作りましょうー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"木枯らしは泣かない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後のMV撮影でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでバスの中で踊るの楽しかったなー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EDA4SYEEN22A8N1VEVQH0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EDFZYQGNP96SVK9JWT001","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EDQ4M3C926VKQHT31CHZ6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EDZ8M2WBAKBDMA1AQH416","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EE5Z9Z6EJHPM7W50KZ2R0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EEBGYJYK74JJ4G5SZWE9T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EEGV389R9TZX8TRDMANMA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B.L.T.さん　12月号"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な写真をたくさん撮って頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビューでは、今までのことを深くお話しさせて頂きました！\nBuddiesの皆さんから\nあの時の気持ちとか、知らなかったことを深く知ることができて良かったと言ってもらえて嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の最後には、卒業証書など頂いて嬉しくなったなー\n高校卒業ぶりの卒業証書。\n素敵な言葉をたくさん書いてくださっていて、元気がでました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EEPA6J3VGYJVQJE6GCJQE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の合間はこれにハマってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EEVZWVBAYSJYN5ETGQ41T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EF19HGDZ57J1N565FQ8YX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01KB2EF6VMHNFNMQA8KKVSJ10P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人になったねー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいば〜い🦒"}],"source":"archive"}